{"abstract":[{"text":"Which part of a spanning construct a Guido Music Notation tag is.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/begin","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/end","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/whole"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Span"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Roughly forty tag names are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…Begin"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"halves of about fifteen base tags — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slurBegin"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slurEnd"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\crescBegin"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\crescEnd"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\tieBegin"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\tieEnd"},{"type":"text","text":", and so on. Rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than give each half its own payload, one payload carries a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/whole","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": the range form, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\slur(c d e)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the tag owns a body.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/begin"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/end"},{"text":": the open form, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\slurBegin c d \\slurEnd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"optionally paired by a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Ident-swift.struct"},{"text":" suffix.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"The two forms are never interchanged","anchor":"The-two-forms-are-never-interchanged","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Begin"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"End"},{"type":"text","text":" pair is not rewritten into a range, nor a range into a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pair, on grounds of totality: open spans may overlap or go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unterminated, and a range is a tree that can express neither."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A real score may contain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slurBegin:1 \\beam( b\/16 \\crescBegin c3 d e&) \\slurEnd:1 \\crescEnd"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which interleaves three spans across the beam’s range. Restricting the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rewrite to the safe subset would be worse than not doing it: identical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fragments would format differently depending on distant context."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"An `end` carries no parameters","anchor":"An-end-carries-no-parameters","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"type":"text","text":" name takes no parameters at all. A payload whose span is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/end"},{"type":"text","text":" therefore refuses typed parameters, and none is ever emitted."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Parameters written on an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"type":"text","text":" tag keep it reserved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through the parser, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer"},{"type":"text","text":" drops them —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedSpanEndParameters(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" — so the tag"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"promotes on the second pass."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Shared-tag-vocabulary","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNLength","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Appearance-swift.struct","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/ControlPoints","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Curve","d